extends ../layouts/default.pug
include ../mixins/index.pug

block main
  +page-banner({ name: pageTitle }, "/terms-and-conditions")

  section.mt_80.mb_100
    .container
      .row.justify-content-center
        .col-lg-8
          p(style="color:#6b7280;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:32px;") Last updated: September 7, 2026

          h2(style="color:#1C1917;font-weight:600;font-size:19px;margin-bottom:12px;") 1. Acceptance of Terms
          p(style="color:#374151;line-height:1.8;") By accessing and using our website, you agree to be bound by these Terms and Conditions. If you do not agree, please do not use our services.

          h2(style="color:#1C1917;font-weight:600;font-size:19px;margin:28px 0 12px;") 2. Orders & Payments
          p(style="color:#374151;line-height:1.8;") All orders are subject to availability. We reserve the right to cancel any order at our discretion. Payment must be completed before an order is processed and shipped.

          h2(style="color:#1C1917;font-weight:600;font-size:19px;margin:28px 0 12px;") 3. Pricing
          p(style="color:#374151;line-height:1.8;") Prices are listed in the currency shown on the website and are subject to change without notice. Promotional prices are valid only during the specified promotion period.

          h2(style="color:#1C1917;font-weight:600;font-size:19px;margin:28px 0 12px;") 4. Intellectual Property
          p(style="color:#374151;line-height:1.8;") All content on this website - including designs, images, and text - is the property of our platform and may not be reproduced without written permission.

          h2(style="color:#1C1917;font-weight:600;font-size:19px;margin:28px 0 12px;") 5. Limitation of Liability
          p(style="color:#374151;line-height:1.8;") We are not liable for any indirect or consequential damages arising from the use of our products or services beyond the amount paid for the relevant order.
